#: src/Settings/PlaybackPage.qml:107
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Hardware decoding"
msgstr "Hardware decoding"

#: src/Settings/PlaybackPage.qml:149
msgctxt "@info:tooltip hardware decoding setting"
msgid ""
"Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. "
"Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If "
"hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software decoding."
"<br><br><ul><li><strong>auto</strong> tries to automatically enable hardware "
"decoding using the first available method.</li><li><strong>auto-safe</"
"strong> similar to auto, but allows only whitelisted methods that are "
"considered “safe”.</li><li><strong>vaapi</strong> works with Intel and AMD "
"GPUs only. It also requires the opengl EGL backend.</li><li><strong>nvdec</"
"strong> the newest, and recommended method to do hardware decoding on Nvidia "
"GPUs.</li><li><strong>cuda</strong> an older implementation of hardware "
"decoding on Nvidia GPUs.</li><li><strong>videotoolbox</strong></"
"li><li><strong>d3d11va</strong></li></ul><br><br>You can read more about "
"hardware decoding here: <a href='https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-"
"hwdec'>https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-hwdec</a><br><br>You can set "
"another hardware decoder by creating a startup custom command <strong>set "
"hwdec <i>decoder_name</i></strong>."
msgstr ""
"Angiv den hardware video afkodnings-API der skal bruges om muligt. Om "
"hardware-afkodning faktisk anvendes kommer an på videoens codec. Hvis "
"hardware-afkodning ikke er muligt, vil mpv falde tilbage på software-"
"afkodning. <br><br><ul><li><strong>auto</strong> forsøger automatisk at "
"bruge hardware-afkodning med den første tilgænglige metode.</"
"li><li><sgtong>auto-safe</strong> lige som auto, men bruger kun hvidlistede "
"metoder der er anset at være \"sikre\".</li><li><strong>vaapi</strong> "
"virker med Intel og AMD GPUer. Den kræver også opengl EGL backenden</"
"li><li><strong>nvdec</strong>er den nyeste og anbefalede metode til hardware-"
"afkodning på Nvidia GPUer.</li><li><strong>cuda</strong> er en ældre "
"implementering af hardware-afkodning på Nvidia GPUer.</"
"li><li><strong>videotoolbox</strong></li></li><li><strong>d3d11va</strong></"
"li></ul><br><br>Du kan læse mere om hardware-afkodning her: You can readYou "
"can read more about hardware decoding here: <a href='https://mpv.io/manual/"
"stable/#options-hwdec'>https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-hwdec</"
"a><br><br> more about hardware decoding here: <a href='https://mpv.io/manual/"
"stable/#options-hwdec'>https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-hwdec</"
"a><br><br>Du kan vælge en anden hardware-afkoder ved at oprette en tilpasset "
"opstartskommando <strong> set hwdec <i>afkodernavn</i></strong>."

